# Git workflow

- One branch per Linear issue, named exactly the issue's Linear `gitBranchName`, created from `origin/main`.
- One PR per issue, against `main`. The PR body ends with `Closes JUS-N`.
- Squash merge only when CI is green. Never merge red or pending.
- Commits are authored as Justin Slay, using the repo's configured git user. Don't override `user.name` or `user.email`.

## No agent attribution

Never add agent attribution in commits, PR titles or bodies, issue comments, or review replies. That means none of:

- `Co-authored-by:` trailers for any agent or tool.
- "Generated with ..." or "Made with ..." footers naming a tool.
- Any mention that an AI or agent wrote the change.

Attribution is Justin's choice alone.
